1
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,320
P'Gun.

2
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:32,199
P'Gun.

3
00:00:35,272 --> 00:00:37,640
Who the hell is bothering me this early?

4
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,948
Damn it.

5
00:00:41,399 --> 00:00:44,333
Maprang, hold on a sec.
What's Earth doing here?

6
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:54,648
Um… Uncle told me
to move in with you.

7
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,642
What's that old man thinking?

8
00:01:00,934 --> 00:01:02,234
Maprang, hold on a sec.

9
00:01:02,436 --> 00:01:03,566
Don't hang up yet.

10
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:08,331
Sorry…
I thought you weren't home.

11
00:01:08,989 --> 00:01:13,915
So you think I'm not home and you're knocking like you're looking for your parents? Annoying.

12
00:01:15,179 --> 00:01:17,739
I'm sorry… didn't mean to bother anyone.

13
00:01:18,531 --> 00:01:20,982
Yeah.
You coming in or not?

14
00:01:25,320 --> 00:01:27,198
What an annoyingly punchable face.

15
00:01:29,201 --> 00:01:30,201
Maprang…

16
00:01:31,702 --> 00:01:34,601
Earth, close the door! You idiot.

17
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:47,520
Hello, Maprang. Let's talk first.

18
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:51,914
Uh… so which room am I supposed to sleep in?

19
00:01:52,774 --> 00:01:53,843
Hold on a sec.

20
00:01:56,775 --> 00:02:03,629
There's only one room. The left one is storage.
You're using my room. We'll sleep together.

21
00:02:05,079 --> 00:02:07,283
We have to sleep together?

22
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,280
You think I *want* to sleep with you?

23
00:02:11,745 --> 00:02:16,165
You showed up out of nowhere.
Who would be prepared for that?

24
00:02:17,109 --> 00:02:22,116
If you're hungry, order Grab.
I'm heading out for a bit.

25
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:27,156
Hello, Maprang.
I'll be out in five minutes.

26
00:02:28,943 --> 00:02:30,566
I'll get dressed quickly.

27
00:02:32,437 --> 00:02:34,366
Hey, talk things out properly first!

28
00:02:35,765 --> 00:02:37,685
So you're going to make up with your girlfriend.

29
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:43,440
Am I gonna survive this…

30
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:49,900
"BRO"
